sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0243/0244 + decisions agent-observer-swamp-acts, single-swamp-node, R2, R4.
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Target Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: node:converge 12<br/>--force (optional)
  Note over GW: Render desired footprint<br/>Caddyfile, DNS, PHP, digests
  Note over GW: Record task, lock Node<br/>task #5132 · node-converge:12
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-node-converge-direct
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5132
  SW->>N: Install pinned observer<br/>curl, sha256 check, install
  SW->>N: Apply changed artifacts<br/>Caddy, DNS, PHP, tmpfiles, residue
  SW->>N: Configure the observer<br/>same key, read-only, restart
  alt every artifact applied
    N-->>SW: digest per artifact
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event · artifacts
    Note over GW: Record footprint digests<br/>NodeFootprint for Node 12
  else an artifact fails
    N--xSW: step exits ≠ 0
    SW->>N: Restore DNS, clean up<br/>DNS backup, rm staged binary
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>failed_artifact, error_code
    Note over GW: Record finished artifacts<br/>next converge retries the rest
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #OP
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
